Package: siano-userland
Name: Siano Driver
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libusb-1.0-0
Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Khronos31/siano-userland
Tag: purpose::console
Description: Userland ISDB-T tuner capture for Siano RIO (PX-S1UD)
 Captures MPEG-TS from Siano-based USB tuners (e.g. PLEX PX-S1UD) via libusb.
 Built on-device for rootless jailbreaks.
 .
 This package redistributes the unmodified Siano firmware blob
 isdbt_rio.inp in binary form under LICENCE.siano
 (Copyright (c) 2005-2014 Siano Mobile Silicon Ltd.). Reverse
 engineering, decompilation, and disassembly of the firmware are
 prohibited. Full terms: /var/jb/usr/share/licenses/siano-ts/LICENCE.siano
 and /var/jb/usr/share/doc/siano-ts/copyright.
 .
 Firmware files are installed under /var/jb/usr/share/siano-ts/ and
 /var/jb/lib/firmware/. The application itself is GPL-2.0-or-later
 (COPYING).
